  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nyala-Kas-Zlingie Highway Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IDB financing will finance part of the construction cost of a 210 km road project connecting the towns of Nyala and Zalingie in the Darfur province of Sudan.  The road will provide a transport link to the Western part of the country and help in the movement of livestock and agricultural produce.</narrative>
  </description>
